docs/adr/0027-thin-core-and-user-owned-workflow-profiles.md-102- - `TestWorkflowProfileAdmissionAndNoProfileDirectPath` starts the unconfigured Claude direct path and checks its frozen launch identity, then checks that a selected profile is frozen. `TestLaunchSkillsAreInjectedOnlyIntoPosseSessions/pi` starts an unconfigured fake Pi Worker and checks the implicit launch identity without a Worker Profile.
docs/adr/0027-thin-core-and-user-owned-workflow-profiles.md:103: - `TestWorkflowRunsRequireUserApprovedProgressionAndRecoverPosition` refuses unapproved and out-of-order transitions, checks that profile edits do not alter active runs, preserves separate Merge authority, and reconstructs run position and Decisions from snapshots.
docs/adr/0027-thin-core-and-user-owned-workflow-profiles.md-104- - `TestWorkerGuardAgainstIsolatedHerdr`, `TestTeardownNeverClosesAReplacementAtThePaneCloseBoundary` and related Teardown tests cover isolation and Task-owned teardown.
docs/adr/0027-thin-core-and-user-owned-workflow-profiles.md-105- - `TestStagingSelectedReviewModesPublishOnlyToStaging` and `TestStagingFullPipelineCIRepairRepublishesAcrossRestart` cover selected review evidence, staging publication and recovery after restart. The complete validation proof is tracked in [#303](https://github.com/Thanhbinh1905/posse/issues/303).
